SUMMARY:🚶‍♂️(NEW) Walk: New Market Go Station to Aurora Go Statio
 n Trail!
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🚶
 ‍♂️(NEW) Fall Walk: New Market Go Station to Aurora Go Station Trail
 !🚶‍♂️\n\nWe’re trying something new! Join us for a **beautiful 
 10 km fall walk** (about 3 hours plus a break) as we make our way from **N
 ew Market GO Station to Aurora GO Station**. Along the way\, we’ll pass 
 through tree-filled areas\, Fairy Lake\, Wesley Brooks Conservation Area\,
  scenic walking paths\, and peaceful waterways. With colourful fall foliag
 e all around\, this will be one of the most stunning walks of the season!\
 n\n***\n\n## 🚆 How We’re Getting There: GO Train\n\n* **Cost:** $10 W
 eekend Day Pass → Buy here\n(Buy after **August 13th** – valid for 10 
 days. Do *not* activate until we all meet up. This is cheaper than Presto 
 or senior fares. Online only.)\n* **Route:** Union Station → New Market 
 GO Station (we are on the Barrie Line heading towards **Allandale Waterfro
 nt**).\n\n***\n\n## ⏰ Meetup Details\n\n* **Meetup Time:** 9:30AM (we’
 ll wait until 9:45 AM before walking over to Union Station).\n* **Meetup S
 pot:** Outside the **Fairmont Royal York Hotel** – look for me wearing m
 y Moose Hat 🦌.\n* **Train Leaves:** 10:01 AM sharp.\n* **Arrival at New
  Market GO Station:** 1100 AM.\n\n***\n\n## 🚌 Return Train Options\n\n*
  1:55 PM – our target return train.\n* 2:55 PM – in case we miss the f
 irst one.\n\n***\n\n## 🚗 Driving Option\n\nIf you’d rather drive:\n\n
 * Meet us at **New Market GO Station** at **11:00 AM.**\n* We will leave p
 romptly at **11:10 AM** – please be on time!\n* You will be responsible 
 for getting back to your parking spot.\n* We will not me walking back.\n\n
 ***\n\n## 💲 Fees\n\n* **Meetup Fee:** $5 cash 💵 or e-transfer 📲 t
 o **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**\n* **GO Train Day Pass:** $10[ (CLICK HERE
 )](https://www.gotransit.com/en/partners-and-promotions/weekend-passes-wit
 h-go)\n\n***\n\n## 📌 What to Bring\n\n* Water\n* Good walking shoes\n* 
 A snack or light lunch\n* Weather-appropriate clothing (it’s fall – la
 yers are your friend!)\n\n***\n\n## 💬 Final Notes\n\nThis group is open
  to everyone – singles\, couples\, or just those wanting to meet new fri
 ends. We also host movies\, hikes\, arts & culture outings\, restaurants\,
  and more.\n\n* You can just **show up on the day of** if you’re not sur
 e in advance – just please be on time!\n* Sometimes things happen and I 
 may need to cancel\, so keep an eye out for updates.\n\n📲 **Join Our Wh
 atsApp Group:**[ Click here to join](https://chat.whatsapp.com/DRFTkxRlHS4
 B3IL1lMleUd)\n\n📧 Questions? Email me at **torontomoviesandoutings@hotm
 ail.com** or post on the Meetup wall.
