SUMMARY:Movie trivia night @ Mom's Basement
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\nBeen qu
 ite some time since we came here for movie trivia. Let's do it again.\n\nN
 ote - small venue gets very cozy. You must be ok with tight spaces/lots of
  people nearby.\n\n**🎬 Movie Trivia Night at Mom’s Basement! 🍿**\n
 **📅 Tuesday\\\, August 25\\| 🕢 Starts 7:30 PM \\(Nick will be there 
 early to grab us a table\\!\\)**\n**📍 Mom’s Basement – 1430 Danfort
 h Ave\, Toronto**\nLights\, camera\, trivia! 🎥\n\nJoin us for a fun and
  friendly night of[ ](https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/moved-to-november-4th-fe
 ature-presentation-movie-trivia-moms-basement-tickets-1798357288059)**[mov
 ie trivia](https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/moved-to-november-4th-feature-prese
 ntation-movie-trivia-moms-basement-tickets-1798357288059)**[ ](https://www
 .eventbrite.ca/e/moved-to-november-4th-feature-presentation-movie-trivia-m
 oms-basement-tickets-1798357288059)at one of the coolest hidden gems on th
 e Danforth — **[Mom’s Basement](http://momsbasement.ca/)**[!](http://m
 omsbasement.ca/) Test your knowledge of classic films\, cult favorites\, a
 nd cinematic deep cuts while enjoying great company\, good vibes\, and may
 be a few laughs over those tricky bonus rounds.\n\n**NOTE** - **while ther
 e is no charge for this event\, members are expected to purchase a drink a
 nd/or food item to support the venue**\n\nImportant - this an accessible v
 enue. Entrance is flat to the sidewalk. Accessible bathroom on main floor.
 \n\nDo you know your Top Gun from your Naked Gun? Your Spielberg from your
  Soderbergh? Your Paxton from your Pullman? If you answered yes to any of 
 these rhetorical questions\, please join us on Tuesday\, November 4th at M
 om’s Basement for Feature Presentation Movie Trivia! There’ll be quest
 ions for all genres across all eras\, so cinephiles of all kinds are welco
 me. It’s free to play and there’s prizes for winners\, so frankly it w
 ould be silly if you didn’t attend. Shall we play a game?\n\nSpace **is 
 limited to 6 people per team**\, so make sure to RSVP early! 🏆 **Prizes
  are up for grabs**\, and bragging rights are on the line for the biggest 
 movie buffs in the room.\n\n### **FOLLOW US [@FPTRIVIA ON INSTAGRAM](https
 ://www.instagram.com/fptrivia/) FOR MORE UPDATES! PLEASE?**\n\nNick will b
 e there early to save a table\, so just look for him when you arrive!\n\n
 🎟️ **Please respect your RSVP** — space is tight\, and no-shows may
  miss out on future events.\nBring your best movie knowledge and your team
  spirit — let’s make it a blockbuster of a night! 🍻
