SUMMARY:🌿 Hogg's Hollow Summer Evening Walk & Dinner 🌅
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n### 
 🌿 Hogg's Hollow Summer Evening Walk & Dinner 🌅\n\nJoin us for a beau
 tiful **summer evening walk** through **Hogg's Hollow**\, one of Toronto's
  most charming and historic neighbourhoods tucked away in the heart of Nor
 th York. With its winding roads\, forested trails\, picturesque bridges\, 
 and peaceful ravines\, it's hard to believe you're still in the city.\n\nW
 e'll stroll through the valley where the **West Don River** winds its way 
 past historic homes\, quiet streets\, and lush green spaces. Along the way
 \, we'll explore the area's fascinating history—from **James Hogg**\, th
 e Scottish settler who established a mill here in the 1820s\, to the tragi
 c\n\n**Hogg's Hollow Disaster** of 1960\, when five workers lost their liv
 es during the construction of a water tunnel\, an event that forever chang
 ed workplace safety laws in Ontario.\n\nAs the evening sun filters through
  the trees\, it's the perfect opportunity to enjoy great conversation\, me
 et new people\, and discover one of Toronto's hidden gems.\n\n📲 **Join 
 Our WhatsApp Group:**[ Click here to join](https://chat.whatsapp.com/DRFTk
 xRlHS4B3IL1lMleUd)\n\n***\n\n📍 **Meetup Location:**\n\nI'll be waiting 
 near the **Shell gas station** (easy to spot!) wearing my famous **Moose H
 at** 🦌\n🏁 **Ending Spot:**\nRight back where we started.\n🕡 **Mee
 tup Time:**\n**6:30 PM** *(I'll wait just 5 minutes.)*\n\n🍗 **Dinner Af
 ter**\n\nAfter the walk\, we'll head to **Swiss Chalet** for a relaxed din
 ner. Whether you're joining for the famous rotisserie chicken\, a salad\, 
 or just great conversation\, it's the perfect way to end a summer evening.
 \n\n💵 **Meetup Fee:** **$5** (cash 💵 or e-transfer 📲 to **[mathew
 maclean@hotmail.com](mailto:mathewmaclean@hotmail.com)**)\n\n🥾 **What t
 o Bring:**\n\n* Water 💧\n* Comfortable walking shoes\n* Bug spray (opti
 onal)\n* A camera—you never know what you'll spot! 📸\n\n☀️ **Weat
 her**\nThis event takes place rain or shine\, except in cases of severe we
 ather.\nAs we always say:\n\n**There's no such thing as bad weather—only
  unsuitable clothing.**\n\n***\n\n**REMEMBER:** Feel free to just show up!
  If you're unsure of your plans\, you're always welcome to decide on the d
 ay.\n\n👤 **Organized by Mathew**\nFor questions\, post on the event wal
 l or email:\n**[torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com](mailto:torontomoviesa
 ndoutings@hotmail.com)**
