SUMMARY:Waterfront Walk  to Sunnyside Beach! 9KM
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n### 
 🌊 Waterfront Walk to Sunnyside Beach\n\nLooking for a relaxing way to e
 njoy the city?\nJoin us for a scenic walk along Toronto’s beautiful wate
 rfront as we make our way to **Sunnyside Beach** — one of the oldest and
  most charming beaches in the city!\n\nThis is a **flat\, beginner-friendl
 y walk**\, perfect for anyone wanting to stretch their legs\, meet new peo
 ple\, and soak up some lakeside vibes.\n\nJust be prepared to keep pace wi
 th the group — we walk at a steady but social speed!\n\n📲 **Join Our 
 WhatsApp Group:**[ Click here to join](https://chat.whatsapp.com/DRFTkxRlH
 S4B3IL1lMleUd)\n\n***\n\n### 📍 Meetup Details:\n\n**Meetup Time:** 11:0
 0am\n⏳ *We’ll wait 5 minutes before heading out.*\n**Meetup Location:*
 * In front of the **BeaverTails Red Building** by the waterfront. Look for
  **Mathew in his signature Moose Hat** — you can’t miss it!\n\n**End P
 oint:** **Sunnyside Beach**\, where we’ll stop to rest\, snack\, chat\, 
 and enjoy the waterfront.\n\n***\n\n### 💵 Meetup Fee:\n\n**$5 cash in p
 erson** or **E-transfer** to:\n📧 **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**\n(*This 
 helps support the group and keeps events going!*)\n\n***\n\n### 🧺 What 
 to Expect:\n\n*\n* A fun and social waterfront walk from the Harbourfront 
 to Sunnyside Beach\n* Time to relax by the water\, have lunch\, and hang o
 ut\n* Bring **something small to share** (cookies\, fruit\, trail mix\, et
 c.)\n* Stay as long or as little as you like – your schedule\, your pace
 !\n\n***\n\n### 🧳 What to Bring:\n\n✅ Water\n✅ Comfortable walking 
 shoes\n✅ A snack and **something to share**\n✅ Sunscreen or a hat (opt
 ional but recommended)\n\n***\n\n### ✅ A Few Reminders:\n\n* You’re we
 lcome to just **show up day-of**\, even if you haven’t RSVPed.\n* This g
 roup is for **anyone looking to be social\, make friends\, or just get out
  of the house**—whether you're single\, partnered\, new to the city\, or
  a local explorer.\n* Sometimes things happen\, and events may need to be 
 cancelled last minute — please keep an eye on your messages!\n\n***\n\n
 👋 **Mathew** is the organizer for this event. If you have questions\, f
 eel free to:\n📩 Post a message on the event wall\n📧 Or email: **toro
 ntomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com**
